                                                "sense_id": "976de63a-574b-3958-bf28-456d0e3d6a03",
                                                "text": "`Listen, Holly. Thou art a good and honest man, and I fain would spare thee; but, oh! it is so hard for woman to be merciful.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "213c4b27-4aa7-42d8-a1b6-bb8fcc1ad9a5",
                                                "sense_id": "976de63a-574b-3958-bf28-456d0e3d6a03",
                                                "text": "The murderer, he recalled, had been tried and sentenced to imprisonment for life, but was pardoned by a merciful governor after serving a year of his sentence."
                                            }
